        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an expert LinkedIn Content Creator. Write a professional, highly engaging post based on the provided trend topic. \nTopic: {{ $json.trends[0] }}\nCRITICAL FORMATTING & STYLE RULES:\n1. NO INTROS/OUTROS: Start directly with the hook. Do not say \"Here is your post\" or use markdown dividers like \"---\".\n2. NO MARKDOWN STARS: Do not use ** or *** for formatting. LinkedIn cannot read it. \n3. USE UNICODE BOLD ONLY: For the main hook line and the keywords at the start of bullet points, use bold Unicode characters (e.g., 𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐂𝐨𝐝𝐞:).\n4. ABSOLUTELY NO EXTRA SYMBOLS: Never use the asterisk character (*) anywhere in the text. If you want to emphasize a keyword, you MUST use Unicode bold, not markdown stars.\n5. STRUCTURE: \n   - 💥 Strong bold hook line\n   - 💡 Context paragraph\n   - 📌 3 clear bullet points (each starting with an emoji and bold keyword)\n   - 🚀 A clear Call-to-Action (CTA) question at the end\n   - 🏷️ 3-5 relevant hashtags at the very bottom\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
